    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Tavern!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure like Link and party like Mario</strong> in this 2D PvP brawler. Dive into ranked arenas, clash in Mario Party-style mini-games, quest with friends, wage guild wars, or just kick back in the tavern. Whether you're here to brawl or banter, the tavern is always open!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranked Arenas</strong> \u2013 Test your skill in intense 1v1, 2v2, 3v3, and 4v4 brawls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls</strong> \u2013 Easy to pick up, glorifying to truly master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fair Play</strong> \u2013 No grind or pay-to-win. Just skill and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tavern Games</strong> \u2013 Dozens of mini-games, solo or with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open World </strong> \u2013 Explore beyond the tavern and uncover new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social Hub</strong> \u2013 Meet other players, form alliances, or talk smack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guild System</strong> \u2013 Join a formidable guild or start your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests </strong> \u2013 Embark on solo or co-op adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Abilities</strong> \u2013 Unlock new tools to fit your own creative playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outfit Customization</strong> \u2013 With over 1,000 unique items to collect.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planned Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cross-Platform Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Play with friends on any device.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monthly Tournaments</strong> \u2013 Watch or brawl live for glory and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guild Customization</strong> \u2013 Design your own guild outfits and emblems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Game Modes</strong> \u2013 More chaos. More variety. More ways to win\u00a0(or lose spectacularly).</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Tavern!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure like Link and party like Mario</strong> in this 2D PvP brawler. Dive into ranked arenas, clash in Mario Party-style mini-games, quest with friends, wage guild wars, or just kick back in the tavern. Whether you're here to brawl or banter, the tavern is always open!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranked Arenas</strong> \u2013 Test your skill in intense 1v1, 2v2, 3v3, and 4v4 brawls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls</strong> \u2013 Easy to pick up, glorifying to truly master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fair Play</strong> \u2013 No grind or pay-to-win. Just skill and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tavern Games</strong> \u2013 Dozens of mini-games, solo or with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open World </strong> \u2013 Explore beyond the tavern and uncover new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social Hub</strong> \u2013 Meet other players, form alliances, or talk smack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guild System</strong> \u2013 Join a formidable guild or start your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests </strong> \u2013 Embark on solo or co-op adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Abilities</strong> \u2013 Unlock new tools to fit your own creative playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outfit Customization</strong> \u2013 With over 1,000 unique items to collect.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planned Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cross-Platform Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Play with friends on any device.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monthly Tournaments</strong> \u2013 Watch or brawl live for glory and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guild Customization</strong> \u2013 Design your own guild outfits and emblems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Game Modes</strong> \u2013 More chaos. More variety. More ways to win\u00a0(or lose spectacularly).</p>",
